==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Metal Slug Defense'''}} and The Battle Cats go head to head for Round 2 of their special collaboration!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 1st (11am) and 15th (10:59)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Metal Slug Defense collab units in a special Rare Capsule set!'''}}<br>
Select the Metal Slug Defense capsules for a chance at awesome units like:<br>
[[HI-DO (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''HI-DO (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs Floating, with chance of knockback! (Area Attack)<br>
[[DONALD MORDEN (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''DONALD MORDEN (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Super tough vs Aliens plus area attacks with knockback!<br>
[[JUPITER KING (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''JUPITER KING (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have chance of knockback & slow vs Aliens!<br>
[[HUGE HERMIT (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''HUGE HERMIT (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs Aliens with Area Attacks!<br>
[[ALLEN O'NEIL (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''「ALLEN O'NEAL (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Survives one lethal attack!<br>
[[SV-001 (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#AA33CC|'''SV-001 (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
High performance one-man tank with area attack!<br>
[[MARS PEOPLE (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''MARS PEOPLE (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Weakens Alien attack power!<br>
[[FIO (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''FIO (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Chance of slowing Alien movement!<br>
[[ERI (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''ERI (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks deliver extra damage vs Aliens!<br>
[[TARMA (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''TARMA (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have chance of knockback vs Aliens!<br>
[[MARCO (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''MARCO (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Chance of freezing Aliens!<br>
<small><small>※ Standard Battle Cats Rare and Super Rare units will also be available when drawing from this special collaboration capsule set. Drawing from other rare capsule sets during this event will not provide Metal Slug Defense collab units.<br>
※ If this capsule set does not appear, ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Metal Slug Defense Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Take on limited edition crossover challenges and collect awesome collab units!<br>
Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages and select the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''"Metal Slug Defense" or "Super Metal Slug Defense"'''}} maps to take on this challenge!<br>
Clearing stages in these maps will give you a small chance to pick up the limited edition Rare unit [[HYAKUTARO (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Hyakutaro'''}}]]! Later stages will give you a better chance of collecting Hyakutaro, or you can get a 100% chance of recruiting him by using a Treasure Radar on any stage!<br>
<small><small>※If Hyakutaro was already collected in a previous campaign, this unit cannot be collected again.<br>
※Once collected, Hyakutaro may be activated by visiting the Upgrade menu and locating it in the Rare Cats section.<br>
※ If these collab stages do not appear, ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Half-Off Catfruit stages during this event!'''}}<br>
Challenge Catfruit stages at a lower cost and pick up the ingredients needed to evolve your favorite Cats!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available every day between 8:00am～10:00am, 12:00pm～2:00pm, and 7:00pm～9:00pm!'''}}<br>
<small><small>※Clear Empire of Cats Ch. 3 to access this event.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Catamin/Catseye Limited Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
On the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between normal Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catamin/Catseye Limited Capsules!'''}}<br>
Speed up your Gamatoto! Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!<br>
<small><small>※The Catseye Limited Capsules provide Catseyes and XP rewards, while Catamin Limited Capsules will provide Catamin and XP!<br>
※The Catamin Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 1 "Greece" is cleared. Catseye Limited Capsules will appear after User Rank 1600 is achieved.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Cat Food Rewards Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this collab campaign, every day you log into the Battle Cats app will reward you with a {{Color|#008000|'''20 Cat Food'''}} present!<br>
Play every day and don't miss out on these free gifts!

Visit the site below for info on Metal Slug Defense!<br>
https://www.snk-corp.co.jp/us/games/apps/metalslug_defense/

